            <p>This tool is provided completely free of charge to help students prepare for competitive exams. You may use it for personal, non-commercial educational purposes.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold dark: mt-8 mb-4">2. User Uploads and Content</h2>
            <p>Since this application runs entirely locally in your browser, you retain full ownership and responsibility for any PDF documents you upload. We do not endorse, review, or store any of your content.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold dark: mt-8 mb-4">3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
            <p>This tool is provided "as is" without any guarantees or warranty. In association with the product, we make no warranties of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, of title, or of non-infringement of third party rights.</p>
            <p>We do not guarantee the absolute accuracy of the auto-slicing AI or OCR tools. You are responsible for verifying your practice questions.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold dark: mt-8 mb-4">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p>In no event shall we be liable for any direct, indirect, punitive, incidental, special consequential damages, to property or life, whatsoever arising out of or connected with the use or misuse of our services.</p>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
